# One file for the whole framework's AI layer (agents 7-10, BYOK).
# Copy this to .env, paste ONE key below, and every AI agent the orchestrator
# starts picks it up automatically - nothing to configure per-agent.
#
# Set ONE provider. If both are set, OpenRouter is used.

# Option A - OpenRouter (default model is free: nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b:free)
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b:free   # swap to any "provider/model" id from https://openrouter.ai/models

# Option B - Anthropic Claude
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# Leaving both blank is fine - agents 1-5 (and the framework itself) run
# with zero AI, no key required. Agents 7-10 just won't start.
